<title>SPAIN: Sevillana chairman set to retire - press.</title>
<headline>Sevillana chairman set to retire - press.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of Spain's Sevillana de Electricidad, Fernando de Ybarra, is to announce his retirement at the next board meeting, the ABC national daily reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Ybarra has been chairman since September 1986.</p>
<p>No-one was immediately available at Sevillana to comment.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
